/></svg></span></div><h2 class="value-title"><span class="type-heading">AI POWERED.</span><br /><span class="type-heading type-heading-second">HUMAN LED.</span></h2><p class="value-intro">Smart tools. Thoughtful design.<br />More value for your business.</p><div class="value-cards"><div><small>01 / INTELLIGENCE</small><h3>AI-powered workflows</h3><p>Technology-assisted creativity, guided by people.</p></div><div><small>02 / VALUE</small><h3>Affordable hosting</h3><p>A practical hosting setup to suit your website and budget.</p></div><div><small>03 / SIMPLICITY</small><h3>Low maintenance</h3><p>Lean websites designed to keep ongoing upkeep simple.</p></div><div><small>04 / LOCAL</small><h3>Proudly Australian</h3><p>Melbourne-based. Personal service for your business.</p></div></div><a class="value-cta" href="#enquiry">Build something better <span><svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></span></a></aside></section>
