org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></span></div></a>)}</div></details></div></section>
 <section class="enquiry-section" id="enquiry" aria-labelledby="enquiry-title"><div class="wrap enquiry-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next move starts here</p><h2 id="enquiry-title">Big idea?<br />Let’s <em>hear it.</em></h2><p>Tell us what you have in mind. A new website, a fresh identity or a stronger digital presence — let’s make it happen.</p><a href="tel:+61494597993">Prefer a chat? 0494 597 993 <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></a></div>
 <form id="enquiry-form" data-endpoint={contactReady ? contactEndpoint : ""} action="#enquiry" method="post" aria-describedby="form-note"><div class="form-fields"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" /></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" /></label><label>Business name <span>(optional)</span><input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="120" /></label><label>What do you need?<select name="service" required><option value="">Select a service</option>{services.map(([title])=><option>{title}</option>)}<option>Something else</option></select></label><label class="form-wide">Tell us about your project<textarea name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="2000" rows="4" placeholder="Your goals, your ideas, your timeline…"></textarea></label></div>{contactReady && <><label class="contact-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Leave this empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label><div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey={turnstileSiteKey} data-action="contact" data-theme="dark" data-size="flexible"></div></>}<p id="form-note">{contactReady ? 'Your details will be used to respond to your enquiry.' : 'Opens a draft in your email app. Review it and press Send to contact CodeMax.'}</p><button class="button" type="submit" disabled><span data-submit-label>{contactReady ? 'Send my enquiry' : 'Prepare my enquiry'}</span><svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></button><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><noscript><p>To send your enquiry without JavaScript, <a href="mailto:info@codemax.com.au">email info@codemax.com.au</a>.</p></noscript></form></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap about" id="about"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / About CodeMax</p><h2>A small team.<br />A personal approach.<br /><em>Your next chapter.</em></h2><div class="founder"><span class="initials">SD</span><div><strong>Subodha De</strong><span>Founder, CodeMax Australia</span></div></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead">Thoughtful design. Clear communication. A team invested in your business.</p><p>We’re a Melbourne-based web development team committed to bringing your online vision to life within your budget. We combine cost-effective solutions with personalised service, tailoring each project to your needs.</p><p>Our mission is to create digital experiences that elevate brands and help them connect with people. From design through delivery, we focus on user-friendly interfaces and open collaboration.</p><div class="values"><div><h3>Built around you</h3><p>Personalised solutions that reflect your business and its goals.</p></div><div><h3>Open collaboration</h3><p>Transparent communication throughout the design process.</p></div><div><h3>Punctuality matters</h3><p>A commitment to delivering your website on time.</p></div><div><h3>Design with purpose</h3><p>Creative, usable experiences that support your online presence.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="feature-band"><div class="wrap feature-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">It’s never too late</p><h2>Step into<br />the <em>limelight.</em></h2></div><div><p>Showcase your talents, skills and achievements with an online presence that reflects who you are. Whether you’re launching a business or refreshing your brand, your next step can start today.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:info@codemax.com.au">Let’s discuss your idea <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></a></div></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap" id="journal"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / From the blog</p><h2>Ideas for your<br /><em>digital presence.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Explore the CodeMax blog <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></a></div><div class="journal-grid"><a href="https://codemax.com.au/dont-miss-out-crucial-mobile-seo-services-australian-website-needs/" class="journal"><small>SEO / Mobile</small><h3>Mobile SEO for Australian websites</h3><p>Explore the role of mobile optimisation in search visibility and user experience.</p><span>Read on the blog <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></span></a><a href="https://codemax.com.au/outrank-rivals-smart-aussie-guide-local-search-engine-optimisation/" class="journal"><small>SEO / Local business</small><h3>Getting found in your local market</h3><p>Local search ideas for businesses looking to connect with nearby customers.</p><span>Read on the blog <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></span></a><a href="https://codemax.com.au/beyond-the-big-smoke-local-search-rankings-regional-businesses/" class="journal"><small>SEO / Regional Australia</small><h3>Online visibility beyond the city</h3><p>Search strategies and opportunities for regional Australian businesses.</p><span>Read on the blog <svg class="link-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg></span></a></div></section>
<section class="seo-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Local studio / Practical support</p><h2>Melbourne web design.<br /><em>Built around your business.</em></h2><p>Choose a starting point that matches what you need: <a href="/services/web-design-melbourne/">a new website or redesign</a>, <a href="/services/seo-content-melbourne/">SEO content writing</a>, or <a href="/services/website-maintenance-melbourne/">website maintenance and support</a>. Our Malvern East studio combines creative design with a practical approach to development and ongoing costs.</p><p>Have an existing website? Share its URL and tell us what you want to improve. We can discuss <a href="/services/website-analysis-melbourne/">website and competitor analysis</a> before deciding which changes are worth making.</p></section>
<section class="seo-faq wrap" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Before you get started</p><h2 id="faq-heading">Your website questions,<br /><em>answered.</em></h2>
<details><summary>How much does a small business website cost?</summary><p>The quote depends on your page count, content, design requirements and features. Hosting, ongoing maintenance and migration should also be considered. Send your priorities and budget through the <a href="#enquiry">enquiry form</a> so we can discuss a suitable scope.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you redesign a website without losing its blog?</summary><p>Existing articles and URLs need to be included in the migration plan. We review what should be retained and map any address changes before launch. Keeping useful content accessible matters; no redesign can guarantee unchanged search rankings.</p></details>
<details><summary>Will the website work on mobile?</summary><p>Responsive design is part of our web design service. We consider readable content, navigation, images and enquiry forms across screen sizes, alongside the desktop experience.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you provide hosting and ongoing support?</summary><p>We can discuss hosting arrangements and <a href="/services/website-maintenance-melbourne/">technical support</a> to suit your setup. The services included, recurring costs and responsibilities are agreed for the project.</p></details>
<details><summary>Where is CodeMax based?</summary><p>CodeMax is based at 1341 Dandenong Rd, Malvern East VIC 3145, Melbourne. Contact us on <a href="tel:+61494597993">0494 597 993</a> or use the enquiry form to discuss your business.</p></details>
</section>
